#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:art_craft.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-"
"weight: 700; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; font-size: 24px;"
"\">The Arts and Crafts Shop</span>"
msgstr ""
"<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-"
"weight: 700; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; font-size: 24px;"
"\">La tienda de manualidades</span>"

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:art_craft.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<span style=\"font-size: 13pt; color: #000000; background-color: "
"transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\"/"
">\n"
"            <span class=\"text-o-color-2\" style=\"background-color: "
"transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;"
"\">\n"
"                <font class=\"text-800\">\n"
"                    Tailored specifically for the world of creativity, this "
"Odoo industry package offers a complete solution for arts and crafts stores. "
"It effectively manages a diverse range of inventory with complex variants, "
"ensuring that you can always meet customer demand for specific colors or "
"materials. The system integrates powerful tools for POS and eCommerce, "
"making it easier to run your store efficiently both online and offline. It "
"is the essential tool for combining artistic passion with professional "
"business management.\n"
"                </font>\n"
"            </span>"
msgstr ""
"<span style=\"font-size: 13pt; color: #000000; background-color: "
"transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\"/"
">\n"
"            <span class=\"text-o-color-2\" style=\"background-color: "
"transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;"
"\">\n"
"                <font class=\"text-800\">\n"
"                    Creado especialmente para el mundo de la creatividad, "
"este paquete de Odoo ofrece una solución integral para los comercios de arte "
"y artesanía. Gestiona eficazmente una amplia gama de productos con múltiples "
"variantes y asegúrate de responder a la demanda de colores y materiales "
"específicos. El sistema incorpora potentes herramientas para puntos de venta "
"y comercio electrónico, lo que permite gestionar tu empresa de forma "
"eficiente tanto en entorno digital como en tienda física. Es la herramienta "
"ideal para combinar la pasión artística con una gestión empresarial "
"profesional.\n"
"                </font>\n"
"            </span>"

